--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The reference host in src/app is wired for whisper.cpp, Foundry Local, and
Piper-plus with VOICEVOX, and calls WeatherAPI. None of them are included in
this repository or in any package, and each carries its own license and terms.

VOICEVOX in particular attaches terms to the use of its synthesized voices,
including attribution requirements that apply to audio produced with them.
Please review the applicable provider terms before use. Operators are responsible
for meeting attribution and other requirements that apply to generated audio.
